&gt; Archive pathway: cia</div><aside class="card redline"><h2>Why This Book</h2><p>The Declassified History of Power, Training, Covert Action, Black Budgets, and Oversight Failure</p></aside></section><section id="phase-four-book-universe" class="section wrap commercial-internal"><h2>Book Universe Route</h2><p class="lead">A public-record route into agencies, oversight, covert architecture, surveillance, contractors, and the documents that show how state power hides in plain sight.</p><div class="grid"><article class="card redline"><span class="label">Reader Promise</span><h3>What this door gives you</h3><p>Open this door for intelligence / public record readers following the Intelligence Dossiers path.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Evidence Boundary</span><h3>How to read it</h3><p>This book is a Next step. Claims remain separated by confirmed record, court record, credible reporting, documented association, disputed claim, and symbolic commentary.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Next Move</span><h3>Follow the system</h3><p class="internal-only" data-internal-only="true">Read the book, then move into the Power Atlas and Evidence Vault routes connected below.</p></article></div><h2>Connected Power Atlas Nodes</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card redline"><span class="label">Power Atlas · Confirmed Record</span><h3>CIA</h3><p>A public-record intelligence node for foreign intelligence, covert action history, oversight failure, declassified files, contractors, liaison networks, and black-budget architecture.</p><a class="btn" href="atlas-cia.html">Open Atlas Node</a></article><article class="card redline"><span class="label">Power Atlas · Confirmed Record</span><h3>NSA</h3><p>A signals-intelligence and cyber-power node for interception, metadata, encryption, cybersecurity, oversight disputes, and public-private communications infrastructure.</p><a class="btn" href="atlas-nsa.html">Open Atlas Node</a></article><article class="card redline"><span class="label">Power Atlas · Confirmed Record</span><h3>Five Eyes</h3><p>A public-record alliance node connecting signals intelligence, liaison arrangements, surveillance architecture, and intelligence-sharing routes.</p><a class="btn" href="atlas-five-eyes.html">Open Atlas Node</a></article><article class="card redline"><span class="label">Power Atlas · Court Record</span><h3>Epstein Records</h3><p>A public-record lane for court filings, exhibits, sworn claims, institutional failures, documented associations, flight-log references, and evidence-boundary analysis.</p><a class="btn" href="atlas-epstein-records.html">Open Atlas Node</a></article></div><h2>Connected Evidence Vault Lanes</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><span class="label">Evidence Vault · Confirmed Record</span><h3>Declassified Archives</h3><p>Agency reading rooms, national archives, historic releases, FOIA libraries, and public declassification collections.</p><a class="btn alt" href="evidence-lane-declassified-archives.html">Open Source Lane</a></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Evidence Vault · Confirmed Record</span><h3>Intelligence Oversight</h3><p>Congressional hearings, parliamentary committees, inspector-general reports, official reviews, and oversight failure records.</p><a class="btn alt" href="evidence-lane-intelligence-oversight.html">Open Source Lane</a></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Evidence Vault · Court Record</span><h3>Court Records</h3><p>Dockets, filings, exhibits, indictments, judgments, depositions, settlements, transcripts, and public legal records.</p><a class="btn alt" href="evidence-lane-court-records.html">Open Source Lane</a></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Evidence Vault · Confirmed Record</span><h3>Financial Records</h3><p>Sanctions, regulator actions, contracts, procurement, lobbying, settlements, fines, grants, and compensation schemes.</p><a class="btn alt" href="evidence-lane-financial-records.html">Open Source Lane</a></article></div><div class="card redline"><h2>Continue The Investigation</h2><p>Start with the book for the full investigation, then use the atlas and evidence vault to follow the source trail.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H1M4F71C" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon US</a><a class="btn alt" href="https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B0H1M4F71C" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon UK</a><a class="btn alt" href="black-file.html">Black File</a><a class="btn alt" href="book-universe.html">Book Universe</a></div></div></section><!-- criminal-conduct-engine:start --><style id="criminal-conduct-engine-style">.criminal-conduct-engine{margin:2rem auto;border:1px solid rgba(255,75,75,.45);background:rgba(7,7,10,.94);box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(165,0,0,.16)}.criminal-conduct-engine>summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;padding:1.15rem 1.25rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;align-items:center}.criminal-conduct-engine>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.criminal-conduct-engine>summary:after{content:'+';font-size:1.5rem;color:#ff5454}.criminal-conduct-engine[open]>summary:after{content:'−'}.criminal-conduct-engine__body{padding:0 1.25rem 1.4rem}.criminal-conduct-status{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:.75rem;margin:1rem 0}.criminal-conduct-status div,.criminal-conduct-category,.criminal-conduct-record{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);padding:1rem}.criminal-conduct-status strong{display:block;font-size:1.35rem;color:#ff6464}.criminal-conduct-category{margin:1rem 0}.criminal-conduct-category h3{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem}.criminal-conduct-category h3 span,.criminal-conduct-badge,.criminal-conduct-grade{border:1px solid rgba(255,80,80,.45);padding:.18rem .5rem;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.05em;text-t